\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For independent nearest-neighbor bond percolation and independent site percolation on $Z^3$ at their respective critical parameters, is the probability that the origin belongs to an infinite open cluster zero?

